  "description": "Centered modal window that interrupts the current flow for critical confirmations, destructive warnings, or short focused forms.\n\nVariants & Properties:\n- Use: Default | Destructive | Form.\n- Size: SM (380px, confirmations) | MD (460px, forms).\n- Properties: 👁️ Close, 👁️ Description, 👁️ Footer, 👁️ Secondary Action, ✏️ Title, ✏️ Description.\n\nHierarchy & usage rules:\n- Always pair over OVERLAY to dim background content.\n- In DialogFooter never place two Primary buttons side by side: always combine 1 secondary button (Outline or Ghost for Cancel) with 1 confirmation button (Primary or Destructive).\n- Use Sheet for wide side inspectors on Web or touch drawers on Mobile; use Date & Time Picker for calendar and time pickers.",
